   "id": "sec1-5",
   "section": "Background",
   "text": "After the Supreme Court of the United States overturned Roe v. Wade and Planned Parenthood v. Casey in its June 2022 decision in Dobbs v. Jackson Women's Health Organization, abortion became illegal from the point of conception in Tennessee on July 25, 2022, without any exceptions.",
   "words": 47,
   "authors": [
