   "id": "sec2-1",
   "section": "Case history",
   "text": "The case's lead plaintiff is Nicole Blackmon, a Tennessee woman who was denied an abortion when she was 15 weeks pregnant, at which point she learned the fetus was unlikely to survive; additionally, Blackmon's pre-existing health conditions increased her risk of stroke during labor and delivery.",
