  {
   "id": "sec2-11",
   "section": "Case history",
   "text": "The state's legal team argued to have the case dismissed as the plaintiffs \"do not have standing\", in part because the physician plaintiffs reside in Nashville, where the district attorney had declared they will not prosecute abortion providers.",
   "words": 39,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1",
    "Editor 2"
   ],
   "author_words": [
