  },
  {
   "id": "sec2-14",
   "section": "Case history",
   "text": "The state's legal team also asserted that the plaintiffs were not presently experiencing a medical emergency, and thus, the case referred to \"hypothetical future scenarios\".",
   "words": 26,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
